00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:12.891
&gt;&gt; Laura: A LITTLE OVER TEN

00:00:12.893 --> 00:00:14.788
WEEKS AGO, MASS RIOTING AND

00:00:14.789 --> 00:00:16.865
LOOTING BROKE OUT IN THE WAKE OF

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:17.512
GEORGE FLOYD’S DEATH.

00:00:17.546 --> 00:00:18.955
HUNDREDS OF MILLIONS OF DOLLARS

00:00:18.956 --> 00:00:21.746
IN DAMAGE WAS DONE.

00:00:21.747 --> 00:00:23.905
LIVES AND 1500 BUSINESSES WERE

00:00:23.939 --> 00:00:24.376
DESTROYED.

00:00:24.411 --> 00:00:26.742
I SPOKE WITH SOME OF THOSE

00:00:26.776 --> 00:00:28.002
BUSINESS OWNERS RIGHT HERE IN

00:00:28.003 --> 00:00:28.475
MINNEAPOLIS.

00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:30.929
&gt;&gt; THIS IS WHERE IT ALL

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:31.330
HAPPENED.

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:32.933
MAY 27TH, 2 DAYS AFTER THE

00:00:32.967 --> 00:00:35.480
KILLING OF GEORGE FLOYD, THE

00:00:35.481 --> 00:00:36.782
AUTOZONE WHICH IS RIGHT HERE

00:00:36.784 --> 00:00:39.087
BURNED TO THE GROUND.

00:00:39.089 --> 00:00:41.373
THEN IT WAS TARGET.

00:00:41.407 --> 00:00:42.404
TERRIBLY DAMAGED, DESTROYED,

00:00:42.438 --> 00:00:43.629
LOOTED.

00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:46.564
IMPORTANT FOR THE COMMUNITY,

00:00:46.599 --> 00:00:48.627
MINNESOTA COMPANY OF COURSE.

00:00:48.661 --> 00:00:50.699
AND THEN THE PRECINCT ABANDONED

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:52.246
NOW, BUT DESTROYED, BURNED, AND

00:00:52.247 --> 00:00:53.814
THEY ALLOWED IT TO BURN.

00:00:53.815 --> 00:00:56.103
MORE THAN TEN WEEKS LATER, WHAT

00:00:56.104 --> 00:00:57.662
IS HAPPENING IN THIS COMMUNITY?

00:00:57.697 --> 00:00:59.453
WHAT ABOUT THESE BUSINESSES THAT

00:00:59.487 --> 00:01:01.346
WANT TO REBUILD, THAT WANT TO

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:02.043
STAY HERE.

00:01:02.045 --> 00:01:03.528
ONE OF THE ROAD BLOCKS, WHAT ARE

00:01:03.529 --> 00:01:07.076
THE PROBLEMS, AND HOW CAN WE

00:01:07.078 --> 00:01:07.667
MOVE FORWARD?

00:01:07.702 --> 00:01:09.881
WE DECIDED TO COME HERE AND TRY

00:01:09.882 --> 00:01:12.115
TO BRING YOU THESE STORIES AND I

00:01:12.117 --> 00:01:14.252
HOPE SHED LIGHT ON WHAT HAPPENS

00:01:14.286 --> 00:01:15.352
TOHAS TO HAPPEN NEXT.

00:01:15.386 --> 00:01:21.457
&gt;&gt; HOW DO YOU JUSTIFY BURNING

00:01:21.491 --> 00:01:23.705
DOWN SOMEONE’S BUSINESS?

00:01:23.739 --> 00:01:26.750
&gt;&gt; Laura: CASEY WHITE AND HER

00:01:26.752 --> 00:01:27.909
HUSBAND CHARLES STARTED AN

00:01:27.911 --> 00:01:32.433
INCREDIBLE BUSINESS MY BUSINESS

00:01:32.434 --> 00:01:35.988
FOR YOUR YEARS AGO.

00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:41.204
&gt;&gt; I WATCHED THE OLD SIDE COME

00:01:41.238 --> 00:01:42.929
BURNING TO THE GROUND.

00:01:42.963 --> 00:01:46.541
MY HUSBAND WAS ASLEEP AND I SAID

00:01:46.543 --> 00:01:50.566
"YOU NEED TO WAKE UP NOW!"

00:01:50.567 --> 00:01:53.009
AND WE SAT THERE AND WATCHED IT

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:55.926
JUST MELT TO THE GROUND.

00:01:55.927 --> 00:01:58.422
ALL OF OUR HARD WORK.

00:01:58.424 --> 00:02:00.530
&gt;&gt; PEOPLE WITH BATS, PEOPLE AT

00:02:00.564 --> 00:02:04.417
THE FRONT WINDOWS, HUNDREDS OF

00:02:04.451 --> 00:02:06.987
PEOPLE WENT IN AND LOOTED.

00:02:07.022 --> 00:02:09.771
THEN THEY CAME BACK THE NEXT

00:02:09.773 --> 00:02:12.340
NIGHT, AND THE NEXT NIGHT.

00:02:12.374 --> 00:02:15.244
SIX SHIRES, IT’S UNBELIEVABLE.

00:02:15.245 --> 00:02:19.927
JOHN WOLF IS A PROMINENT

00:02:19.962 --> 00:02:21.285
MINNEAPOLIS BUSINESS DEALER.

00:02:21.286 --> 00:02:23.369
&gt;&gt; Laura: THIS IS THE FAMOUS

00:02:23.404 --> 00:02:24.757
DOOR OF HER EVERYBODY WAS COMING

00:02:24.758 --> 00:02:26.199
IN AND OUT DURING THE NIGHTS OF

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:27.450
THE RIOTS AND THE LOOTING.

00:02:27.484 --> 00:02:30.251
THEY TOOK AS MUCH AS THEY COULD

00:02:30.253 --> 00:02:31.853
OUT OF THAT DOOR.

00:02:31.854 --> 00:02:34.016
&gt;&gt; THEY WERE COMING IN FROM THE

00:02:34.051 --> 00:02:36.378
BASEMENT, THEY WERE COMING OUT

00:02:36.412 --> 00:02:37.937
HERE, THEY WERE TAKING SHOPPING

00:02:37.971 --> 00:02:38.615
CARTS.

00:02:38.616 --> 00:02:40.189
&gt;&gt; Laura: HOW MUCH MERCHANDISE

00:02:40.191 --> 00:02:42.177
WAS TAKEN OUT?

00:02:42.178 --> 00:02:44.905
&gt;&gt; A MILLION DOLLARS WORTH OF

00:02:44.907 --> 00:02:45.600
MERCHANDISE.

00:02:45.601 --> 00:02:47.569
MORE IMPORTANTLY THAN THAT, IT’S

00:02:47.603 --> 00:02:49.741
NOW TAKEN 40 PLUS JOBS AWAY FROM

00:02:49.742 --> 00:02:51.401
THE PEOPLE WHO LIVE IN THE

00:02:51.435 --> 00:02:51.922
NEIGHBORHOOD.

00:02:51.923 --> 00:02:54.122
WHO LIVED, SHOPPED, AND WORK

00:02:54.123 --> 00:02:54.471
HERE.

00:02:54.472 --> 00:02:56.914
WHAT HAPPENS TO THOSE GUYS?

00:02:56.915 --> 00:02:58.825
&gt;&gt; Laura: 30 YEARS AGO, HE

00:02:58.826 --> 00:03:01.125
CAME HERE WITH HIS FAMILY FROM

00:03:01.126 --> 00:03:03.163
ETHIOPIA FOR A BETTER LIFE.

00:03:03.164 --> 00:03:06.447
THIS IS WHAT’S LEFT OF IT.

00:03:06.448 --> 00:03:08.009
THIS IS WHAT HAPPENS THOUGH MIKE

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:11.681
HAPPENED TEN WEEKS AGO AT THE

00:03:11.683 --> 00:03:12.866
MINNEAPOLIS RIOTS.

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:15.197
&gt;&gt; WE PUT OUR SWEAT INTO THIS

00:03:15.231 --> 00:03:15.838
BUILDING.

00:03:15.839 --> 00:03:19.136
&gt;&gt; Laura: I HEARD THE CITY HAD

00:03:19.171 --> 00:03:24.072
BEEN IN TOUCH WITH YOU ABOUT ONE
ISSUE INVOLVING...

00:03:24.107 --> 00:03:24.843
ISSUE INVOLVING...

00:03:24.878 --> 00:03:31.015
&gt;&gt; THE CITY CAME IN AND PUT UP

00:03:31.016 --> 00:03:34.706
WITH THE FUNDS AS YOU SEE HERE.

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:37.053
AND THEY SENT OUT THE BILL FOR

00:03:37.054 --> 00:03:37.495
$3700.

00:03:37.496 --> 00:03:39.057
THEY SAID THEY DON’T HAVE ANY

00:03:39.058 --> 00:03:39.624
RESOURCES.

00:03:39.658 --> 00:03:43.648
SO THE CITY THAT YOU SUPPORT,

00:03:43.682 --> 00:03:45.845
THE BIG COMMUNITIES, SEND YOU A

00:03:45.879 --> 00:03:47.025
BILL?

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.444
ENOUGH IS ENOUGH.

00:03:48.445 --> 00:03:51.213
LET’S REBUILD THIS COMMUNITY AND

00:03:51.247 --> 00:03:52.914
TO STAND BY IT.

00:03:52.948 --> 00:03:55.569
WE LET OUR COUNTRY FOR A FUTURE

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:57.138
TO SEE THE AMERICAN DREAM.

00:03:57.172 --> 00:03:59.725
AND LOOK HOW IT HAPPENED.

00:03:59.759 --> 00:04:02.148
WE HAVE NOT DONE ANYTHING WRONG.

00:04:02.149 --> 00:04:04.870
THE PEACEFUL PROTEST WAS

00:04:04.905 --> 00:04:07.463
HIJACKED, THEN THE GOVERNMENT

00:04:07.498 --> 00:04:09.026
CAN -- WHERE ARE THEY?

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.247
IT’S BEEN TEN WEEKS.

00:04:10.248 --> 00:04:12.386
NO RESPONSE.

00:04:12.387 --> 00:04:14.639
NO RESPONSE.

00:04:14.673 --> 00:04:16.417
&gt;&gt; Laura: NO RESPONSE.

00:04:16.418 --> 00:04:19.218
SILENCE WAS AS DEAFENING ON THE

00:04:19.252 --> 00:04:20.292
NIGHT ON THE RIOTS.

00:04:20.327 --> 00:04:22.552
THE SILENCE FROM ELECTED

00:04:22.553 --> 00:04:25.173
OFFICIALS IS STILL DEAFENING.

00:04:25.207 --> 00:04:26.671
LARRY McKENZIE, LONGTIME

00:04:26.672 --> 00:04:28.961
HIGH SCHOOL BASKETBALL COACH,

00:04:28.995 --> 00:04:30.367
YOUTH ADVOCATES, AND NORTH

00:04:30.368 --> 00:04:30.719
MINNEAPOLIS.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:32.005
SO MANY PEOPLE LOVE YOU, LARRY.

00:04:32.039 --> 00:04:33.771
IT WAS SHE COULD BE IN THE

00:04:33.773 --> 00:04:35.767
STUDIO WITH ME HERE.

00:04:35.801 --> 00:04:37.603
WHAT IS IT GOING TO TAKE TO

00:04:37.604 --> 00:04:39.663
TRULY GET MINNEAPOLIS BACK ON

00:04:39.698 --> 00:04:40.256
ITS FEET?

00:04:40.291 --> 00:04:41.370
THESE ARE GREAT PEOPLE.

00:04:41.372 --> 00:04:43.989
I GOT A CHANCE TO MEET SO MANY

00:04:44.024 --> 00:04:45.298
WONDERFUL PEOPLE TODAY.

00:04:45.299 --> 00:04:47.315
THESE ARE GOOD NEIGHBORS, GOOD

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:48.510
PEOPLE, BUT THEY ARE MAD.

00:04:48.511 --> 00:04:51.106
AND THEY ARE HEARTBROKEN, BUT

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:53.811
THEY ARE MAD.

00:04:53.845 --> 00:04:56.098
&gt;&gt; I MEAN, RIGHTFULLY SO.

00:04:56.133 --> 00:05:00.147
IN TERMS OF WHAT IT’S GOING TO

00:05:00.181 --> 00:05:04.472
TAKE, ONE OF THE THINGS IS A

00:05:04.507 --> 00:05:06.386
TIME AROUND ELECTIONS AND

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:07.802
POLITICIANS MAKING PROMISES AND

00:05:07.837 --> 00:05:09.885
THOSE KIND OF THINGS.

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:11.883
IT’S GOING TO TAKE REALLY THE

00:05:11.917 --> 00:05:14.884
COMMUNITY HOLDING THOSE WHO ARE

00:05:14.919 --> 00:05:16.119
IN THOSE POSITIONS ACCOUNTABLE.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:19.086
&gt;&gt; Laura: ASKED A NUMBER OF

00:05:19.087 --> 00:05:21.706
THE FOLKS I INTERVIEWED WHERE

00:05:21.707 --> 00:05:23.994
THE POLITICIANS ARE?

00:05:24.028 --> 00:05:26.147
THEY HAPPEN TO BE MOSTLY

00:05:26.181 --> 00:05:26.559
DEMOCRATS.

00:05:26.561 --> 00:05:28.375
THEY SAID NO ONE IS HERE.

00:05:28.376 --> 00:05:30.792
WE NEVER HEAR FROM THEM.

00:05:30.794 --> 00:05:32.069
WE CALL THEM, THEY OFFER

00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:33.820
SYMPATHY, BUT THEY SAY WE HAVE

00:05:33.821 --> 00:05:34.825
TO HAVE A CHANGE.

00:05:34.826 --> 00:05:36.757
AND THE NEW PEOPLE COME IN AND

00:05:36.792 --> 00:05:37.924
THEY ARE NO GOOD, WE WILL KICK

00:05:37.958 --> 00:05:39.148
THEM OUT TOO.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:40.181
THAT WAS BASICALLY THE

00:05:40.182 --> 00:05:41.091
SENTIMENT.

00:05:41.092 --> 00:05:43.320
THEY WANT POLITICAL CHANGE.

00:05:43.321 --> 00:05:45.620
&gt;&gt; I DON’T THINK YOU CAN -- I

00:05:45.654 --> 00:05:48.912
DON’T THINK I WOULD DISAGREE.

00:05:48.946 --> 00:05:52.468
I THINK OBVIOUSLY FROM WHAT I

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:54.411
HAVE SEEN THAT RIGHT NOW WE HAVE

00:05:54.445 --> 00:05:57.267
LEADERSHIP THAT IS NOT IN TOUCH

00:05:57.301 --> 00:06:00.204
WITH THE COMMUNITY, THAT IS NOT

00:06:00.205 --> 00:06:02.742
NECESSARILY REPRESENTING THE

00:06:02.743 --> 00:06:04.357
VOICE OF THE COMMUNITY.

00:06:04.358 --> 00:06:06.248
&gt;&gt; Laura: I’M GOING TO BRING

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:07.679
YOU BACK TOMORROW NIGHT, BECAUSE

00:06:07.681 --> 00:06:09.006
WE WILL BE HERE TOMORROW NIGHT.

